  "body": "v16.42 establishes a unit-repair theorem for the overlapping-core family T(d,m), d>=0,m>=3, k=d+2, q=2 at every internal vertex. This is a compositional family; universal unit barriers and intrinsic indecomposability remain unresolved.\n\nA fresh-label substitution preserves all internal hitting numbers by child-coverage domination. Saturation forces singleton side branches and a two-label overlapping core. A third core leaf permits zero-cost normalization. Exchanges between terminal palette blocks create only one unit deviation at their binary lowest common ancestor. This proves k!/2 exact components, each of size 3^m-2*2^m+1; all independent scalar barriers between distinct components are 1, and the separate LEX triple is (1,1,1). Within components barriers are 0.\n\nFinite scope is exactly (d,m)=(0,3),(0,4),(0,5),(1,3),(1,4),(2,3). All admitted states and primitive edges are independently rebuilt, but only the all-internal-2 profile is barrier-tested. Every predicted exact-state identity is independently constructed and compared by set equality.\n\nObserved: FAMILY_THEOREM_VALIDATED; 572/572 zero normalizations;72/72 theorem exchange paths;0 construction failures;0 nonunit pairs. The three d=0 cases provide connectivity tests, not nontrivial barrier pairs. 66 of 72 pairs had prior v16.41 threshold evidence, disclosed in preregistration; the constructive certificates are new. The inherited JSON field construction_paths counts partition-profile constructions; theorem_paths counts this stage's 72 overlapping-core constructions.\n\nProvenance: verified parent 6c5dae8ace7b06f3b7f071f5398976c532da2578; prospective protocol 274a000a79ee53846ee8a585a7e89c4e43c637c8; scientific source 19464eafdf311d3b485a4fc363ded1a1ebc3cb80.\nScientific run https://github.com/proteinfoldingengine/WetLabEngine/actions/runs/36792642585 passed 387 inherited + 44 new = 431 checks, two expected-failure diagnostics, independent graph/path verification and fresh parent replay. Root audit verified the API ZIP digest, all 49 manifest entries, all 1,396 source/input Git blobs, complete passing test logs and byte-identical parent science.\nIndependent mathematical/source review accepted the proof and implementation before execution; independent result review confirmed these scope limits.\n\nPublication 3532727c11fd4c51c73760a99b1d7409ccf49fb9 passed a fresh 431-check execution and reproduced every scientific byte. Root audited the publication ZIP, all source and input blobs, complete publication manifest and unchanged scientific source. Status: READY FOR MERGE; actual-merge rerun and verified durable receipt still required before closure.",
